  "goodToKnow": "Der Lenker is the handlebars of a bicycle or motorbike, and also the driver of a vehicle (official German, especially Austrian: der Fahrzeuglenker). Lenken means to steer and to direct: den Blick auf etwas lenken (to draw attention to). Das Lenkrad is a car's steering wheel, and die Lenkung its steering. Figuratively, die Geschicke lenken means to direct affairs. Plural: die Lenker."
